{"id":"744b67e821b17ac7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/607_命令逻辑_Imperative_Logic.md","title":"607 命令逻辑 Imperative Logic","display":"607_命令逻辑_Imperative_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>描述公式头的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}^2\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}^2\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>描述公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{do},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{test}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{do},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{test}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{do}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{do}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{seq}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{choice}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{choice}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{test}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{test}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"!A=\\operatorname{do}(A),\\qquad c;d=\\operatorname{seq}(c,d),\\qquad c\\sqcup d=\\operatorname{choice}(c,d),\\qquad ?A=\\operatorname{test}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[!A=\\operatorname{do}(A),\\qquad c;d=\\operatorname{seq}(c,d),\\qquad c\\sqcup d=\\operatorname{choice}(c,d),\\qquad ?A=\\operatorname{test}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生公式记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad \\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad \\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式与命令\">2. 公式与命令</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(!A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c;d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c;d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\sqcup d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c\\sqcup d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(?A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>判断对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{State}_{607}=\\{s:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{State}_{607}=\\{s:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}=\n(\\{F\\}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607})\n\\cup(\\{C\\}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}=\n(\\{F\\}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607})\n\\cup(\\{C\\}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>公式自由变元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令自由变元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(!A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(!A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c;d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c;d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c\\sqcup d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c\\sqcup d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(?A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(?A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-替换\">4. 替换</h1>\n<p>对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，本地定义有限子集集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\quad Y=\\{e(j):j&lt;k\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\quad Y=\\{e(j):j&lt;k\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑相对于命题原子嵌入定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\n=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\n=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>恒等嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\mapsto\\operatorname{atom}(p)\">\\(p\\mapsto\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\)</span> 的支撑为空，单点改变的支撑至多为单元素集，二者均在此域内。公式扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma_F\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_F(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_F(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma_C\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}(\\sigma,c)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}(\\sigma,c)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(!A)=!\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(!A)=!\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(c;d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c);\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(c;d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c);\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(c\\sqcup d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c)\\sqcup\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(c\\sqcup d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c)\\sqcup\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(?A)=?\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(?A)=?\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子，公式和命令的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价均为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-命题公理与带状态判断\">5. 命题公理与带状态判断</h1>\n<p>本轮固定命令主判断为具体前后态的执行推出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,s,A)\">\\((F,s,A)\\)</span> 表示状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 满足描述公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,s,c,t)\">\\((C,s,c,t)\\)</span> 表示命令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 可从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 执行到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>。状态是第2节的赋值函数，不是隐去的自由参数。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{607}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}\\cup\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{607}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}\\cup\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{607}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{607}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公理判断和可直接核验的原子事实为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{JAx}_{607}={}&amp;\\{(F,s,A):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{607}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(F,s,\\operatorname{atom}(p)):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},s(p)=1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(F,s,\\neg\\operatorname{atom}(p)):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},s(p)=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{JAx}_{607}={}&amp;\\{(F,s,A):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{607}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(F,s,\\operatorname{atom}(p)):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},s(p)=1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(F,s,\\neg\\operatorname{atom}(p)):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop},s(p)=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-执行规则关系\">6. 执行规则关系</h1>\n<p>以下集合式中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\">\\(s,t,u\\)</span> 均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{State}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\">\\(c,d\\)</span> 均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。每个列出的适型实例都在相应关系中，且没有其他实例。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}=\\{(((F,s,A),(F,s,A\\to B)),(F,s,B))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}=\\{(((F,s,A),(F,s,A\\to B)),(F,s,B))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Do}^{607}=\\{(((F,t,A)),(C,s,!A,t))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Do}^{607}=\\{(((F,t,A)),(C,s,!A,t))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}=\\{(((F,t,A\\to B),(C,s,!A,t)),(C,s,!B,t))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}=\\{(((F,t,A\\to B),(C,s,!A,t)),(C,s,!B,t))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,!A,t),(C,s,!B,t)),(C,s,!(A\\land B),t))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,!A,t),(C,s,!B,t)),(C,s,!(A\\land B),t))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,c,t),(C,t,d,u)),(C,s,c;d,u))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,c,t),(C,t,d,u)),(C,s,c;d,u))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceL}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,c,t)),(C,s,c\\sqcup d,t))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceR}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,d,t)),(C,s,c\\sqcup d,t))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceL}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,c,t)),(C,s,c\\sqcup d,t))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceR}^{607}=\\{(((C,s,d,t)),(C,s,c\\sqcup d,t))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceL}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceR}^{607},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}=\\{(((F,s,A)),(C,s,?A,s))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceL}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChoiceR}^{607},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}=\\{(((F,s,A)),(C,s,?A,s))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则是 FMP、Do、DoW、DoAnd、Seq、Choice、Test 的并，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{607}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{607}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\)</span>。Seq 的中间态必须逐字相同；Do 和 DoW 检验目标态，Test 检验源态且保持该态。公式替换和命令替换只是第4节的结构函数，不自动改写判断中的状态。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{607}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{607}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,J_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,J_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\">\\(J_i\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\)</span>；每行至少满足以下一个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(J_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{J_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{J_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\mathsf{JAx}_{607}\">\\(J_i\\in\\mathsf{JAx}_{607}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_0,\\ldots,j_{k-1}&lt;i\">\\(j_0,\\ldots,j_{k-1}&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((J_{j_h})_{h&lt;k},J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{607}\">\\(((J_{j_h})_{h&lt;k},J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{607}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\bigcup_{h&lt;k}\\Delta_{j_h}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\bigcup_{h&lt;k}\\Delta_{j_h}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第三支按第6节穷尽的七类规则检查，不能从同一对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,t)\">\\((s,t)\\)</span> 的两个执行前提直接生成顺序执行。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{607}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},J_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{607}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},J_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可推出性和证书\">8. 可推出性和证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}J\\Longleftrightarrow J\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{607}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{607}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}J\\Longleftrightarrow J\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{607}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{607}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令可推出性仍以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{607}\">\\(\\Vdash_{607}\\)</span> 表示，但其参数现显式含前后态：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{607}(s,c,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}(C,s,c,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{607}(s,c,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}(C,s,c,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{607}(\\Gamma)=\\{(J,\\pi):J\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607},\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{607}(\\Gamma),\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{607}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,J)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{607}(\\Gamma)=\\{(J,\\pi):J\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607},\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{607}(\\Gamma),\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{607}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,J)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-执行语义及后承\">9. 执行语义及后承</h1>\n<p>在第2节的固定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{State}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\)</span> 上递归定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow s(p)=1,\\qquad s\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow s(p)=1,\\qquad s\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(s\\Vdash_{F,607}A),\\qquad\ns\\Vdash_{F,607}(A\\to B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(s\\Vdash_{F,607}A)\\lor s\\Vdash_{F,607}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(s\\Vdash_{F,607}A),\\qquad\ns\\Vdash_{F,607}(A\\to B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(s\\Vdash_{F,607}A)\\lor s\\Vdash_{F,607}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令解释是集合函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{C,607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{State}_{607}^2),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{C,607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{State}_{607}^2),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦!A⟧_{C,607}=\\{(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}^2:t\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦!A⟧_{C,607}=\\{(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}^2:t\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦?A⟧_{C,607}=\\{(s,s):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦?A⟧_{C,607}=\\{(s,s):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦c;d⟧_{C,607}=\\{(s,u)\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}^2:\\exists t\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\ ((s,t)\\in⟦c⟧_{C,607}\\land(t,u)\\in⟦d⟧_{C,607})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦c;d⟧_{C,607}=\\{(s,u)\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}^2:\\exists t\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\ ((s,t)\\in⟦c⟧_{C,607}\\land(t,u)\\in⟦d⟧_{C,607})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦c\\sqcup d⟧_{C,607}=⟦c⟧_{C,607}\\cup⟦d⟧_{C,607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦c\\sqcup d⟧_{C,607}=⟦c⟧_{C,607}\\cup⟦d⟧_{C,607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>真判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607}=\\{(F,s,A):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\}\n\\cup\\{(C,s,c,t):s,t\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},(s,t)\\in⟦c⟧_{C,607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607}=\\{(F,s,A):s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\}\n\\cup\\{(C,s,c,t):s,t\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607},c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},(s,t)\\in⟦c⟧_{C,607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{607}J\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\land J\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\land\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607}\\Rightarrow J\\in\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{607}J\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\land J\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\land\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607}\\Rightarrow J\\in\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里状态已经是判断的坐标，故后承按同一批带状态前提检验。JAx 各项为真；FMP 保持当前态，Do/DoW/DoAnd 检验同一目标态，Test 产生恒等执行，Choice 使用关系并，Seq 使用所携中间态见证。因此由有限证明长度归纳，真前提只能推出真判断。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分与验收\">10. 目标区分与验收</h1>\n<p>本系统是成对执行判断演算。Cmd、FV、FSub、CSub 和四种命令构造全部保持；合成作用落实到带中间态的 Seq，取消无状态的命令授权读法。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atom}(p_0)\">\\(p=\\operatorname{atom}(p_0)\\)</span>，状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(p_0)=1\">\\(s(p_0)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(p_0)=0\">\\(t(p_0)=0\\)</span>（其他原子任取）。原子事实给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,s,p)\">\\((F,s,p)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,t,\\neg p)\">\\((F,t,\\neg p)\\)</span>；Test 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,s,?p,s)\">\\((C,s,?p,s)\\)</span>，Do 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,s,!\\neg p,t)\">\\((C,s,!\\neg p,t)\\)</span>，Seq 合法推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,s,?p;!\\neg p,t)\">\\((C,s,?p;!\\neg p,t)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=?p;!\\neg p\">\\(c=?p;!\\neg p\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的任何执行终态都使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 假，不能再通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?p\">\\(?p\\)</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦c;c⟧=\\varnothing\">\\(⟦c;c⟧=\\varnothing\\)</span>。同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,s,c,t)\">\\((C,s,c,t)\\)</span> 不能充当 Seq 的第二前提，因为第二前提要求源态为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>；报告的自合成反例被阻断。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{Imp}_{607}=(&amp;\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\mathsf{State}_{607},\\mathsf{Jud}_{607},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607},\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607},\\mathsf{Subst}_{607},\\operatorname{FSub}_{607},\\operatorname{CSub}_{607},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{Ax}_{607},\\mathsf{JAx}_{607},\\mathsf{Rule}_{607},\\mathsf{Proof}_{607},\\operatorname{last}_{607},\\vdash_{607},\\Vdash_{607},\\mathsf{Cert}_{607},\n\\Vdash_{F,607},⟦-⟧_{C,607},\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607},\\models_{607}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{Imp}_{607}=(&amp;\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\mathsf{State}_{607},\\mathsf{Jud}_{607},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607},\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607},\\mathsf{Subst}_{607},\\operatorname{FSub}_{607},\\operatorname{CSub}_{607},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{Ax}_{607},\\mathsf{JAx}_{607},\\mathsf{Rule}_{607},\\mathsf{Proof}_{607},\\operatorname{last}_{607},\\vdash_{607},\\Vdash_{607},\\mathsf{Cert}_{607},\n\\Vdash_{F,607},⟦-⟧_{C,607},\\mathsf{TrueJud}_{607},\\models_{607}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目给出描述公式、命令、带状态的有限推导和四构造执行解释；不宣称演算完备。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与命令","text":"2. 公式与命令","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换","text":"4. 替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-命题公理与带状态判断","text":"5. 命题公理与带状态判断","level":1},{"id":"6.-执行规则关系","text":"6. 执行规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可推出性和证书","text":"8. 可推出性和证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-执行语义及后承","text":"9. 执行语义及后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分与验收","text":"10. 目标区分与验收","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}^2\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{do},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{test}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{do}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seq}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{choice}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{test}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}.","display":true},{"tex":"!A=\\operatorname{do}(A),\\qquad c;d=\\operatorname{seq}(c,d),\\qquad c\\sqcup d=\\operatorname{choice}(c,d),\\qquad ?A=\\operatorname{test}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad \\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\